[0.638207, "o", "──────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n📊 Grove Statistics:\r\n   • Total Trees: 2\r\n   • Total Agents: 6\r\n   • Total Keywords: 33\r\n\r\n✅ Grove routing example completed successfully!\r\n\r\n💡 Key Takeaways:\r\n   • Grove pattern enables intelligent task routing to specialists\r\n   • KeywordMatch provides fast, deterministic routing\r\n   • Fallback trees ensure tasks are never left unrouted\r\n   • Multiple agents per tree enable fine-grained specialization\r\n\r\n🔄 Alternative Routing Strategies:\r\n   • SemanticSimilarity: Uses embeddings for contextual matching\r\n   • LlmRouting: Let an LLM analyze and route tasks intelligently\r\n\r\n📚 For production use:\r\n   • Integrate with GroveExecutionService for actual routing\r\n   • Add embedding service for SemanticSimilarity routing\r\n   • Configure LLM adapter for LlmRouting strategy\r\n"]
